      "side": 1,
      "message": "This seems like a good change. Is there a reason to restrict it to just Dewatt, versus making it the default behavior for all boards?\n\nLooking around a bit, the common function was created with: [lid_angle: Create a common callback for lid angle changes](https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/3069175)\n\nThat CL shows a lot of boards are using the implementation you\u0027re adding here, so moving this up to `src/platform/ec/common/lid_angle.c` would clean up a lot of duplication. I don\u0027t see any discussion about that in the linked CL, so it doesn\u0027t seem it was explicitly not included as part of that cleanup for any reason.",
      "revId": "7f00fc620e6848524550790861611175ca75fc3d",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
